ad to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',4),('CVE-2024-0031','2024-02-16','2024-12-16','Analyzed','In attp_build_read_by_type_value_cmd of att_protocol.cc , there is a possible out of bounds write due to improper input validation. This could lead to remote code execution with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'google','android',4),('CVE-2024-0033','2024-02-16','2024-12-16','Analyzed','In multiple functions of ashmem-dev.cpp, there is a possible missing seal due to a heap buffer overflow. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',6),('CVE-2024-0034','2024-02-16','2025-03-19','Modified','In BackgroundLaunchProcessController, there is a possible way to launch arbitrary activity from the background due to BAL Bypass. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',4),('CVE-2024-0035','2024-02-16','2024-12-16','Analyzed','In onNullBinding of TileLifecycleManager.java, there is a possible way to launch an activity from the background due to a missing null check. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',4),('CVE-2024-0036','2024-02-16','2024-12-16','Analyzed','In startNextMatchingAct