 User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.0,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.0,'google','android',4),('CVE-2024-0042','2024-05-07','2024-12-17','Analyzed','In TBD of TBD, there is a possible confusion of OEM and DRM certificates due to improperly used crypto. This could lead to local bypass of DRM content protection with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',2),('CVE-2024-0043','2024-05-07','2025-03-29','Modified','In multiple locations, there is a possible notification listener grant to an app running in the work profile due to a logic error in the code. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',4),('CVE-2024-0046','2024-03-11','2024-12-16','Analyzed','In installExistingPackageAsUser of InstallPackageHelper.java, there is a possible carrier restriction bypass due to a logic error in the code. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',4),('CVE-2024-0048','2024-03-11','2024-12-16','Analyzed','In Session of AccountManagerService.java, there is a possible method to retain foreground service privileges due to incorrect handling of null responses. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',4),('CVE-2024-0049','2024-03-11','2024-12-16','Analyzed','In multiple locations, there is a possible out of bounds write