 interaction is needed for exploitation. Patch ID: ALPS08441150; Issue ID: ALPS08441150.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'mediatek, google','mt6761, mt8167s, android, mt6895, mt6985',2),('CVE-2024-20011','2024-02-05','2025-06-20','Modified','In alac decoder, there is a possible information disclosure due to an incorrect bounds check. This could lead to remote code execution with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation. Patch ID: ALPS08441146; Issue ID: ALPS08441146.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'mediatek, google','mt8312d, mt8195, mt8167, mt8167s, mt8168',2),('CVE-2024-20015','2024-02-05','2024-11-21','Modified','In telephony, there is a possible escalation of privilege due to a permissions bypass. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation. Patch ID: ALPS08441419; Issue ID: ALPS08441419.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'mediatek, google','mt8798, mt6761, mt8321, android, mt6895',2),('CVE-2024-20017','2024-03-04','2025-05-05','Analyzed','In wlan service, there is a possible out of bounds write due to improper input validation. This could lead to remote code execution with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation Patch ID: WCNCR00350938; Issue ID: MSV-1132.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'mediatek, openwrt','software_development_kit, mt7986, mt7915, mt7622, mt6890',5),('CVE-2024-20018','2024-03-04','2025-04-22','Analyzed','In wlan driver, there is a possible out of bounds write due to improper input validation. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation. Patch ID: WCNCR00348479; Issue ID: MS