25-01-15','Analyzed','A vulnerability was found in Tenda FH1205 2.0.0.7(775) and classified as critical. Affected by this issue is the function formSetCfm of the file /goform/setcfm. The manipulation of the argument funcpara1 leads to stack-based buffer overflow. The attack may be launched remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The identifier of this vulnerability is VDB-258296. NOTE: The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'tenda','fh1205_firmware, fh1205',8),('CVE-2024-30100','2024-06-11','2024-11-21','Modified','Microsoft SharePoint Server Remote Code Execution Vulnerability',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'microsoft','sharepoint_server',2),('CVE-2024-30101','2024-06-11','2024-11-21','Modified','Microsoft Office Remote Code Execution Vulnerability',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.6,'microsoft','365_apps, office',2),('CVE-2024-30102','2024-06-11','2024-11-21','Modified','Microsoft Office Remote Code Execution Vulnerability',7.3,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.3,'microsoft','365_apps',2),('CVE-2024-30103','2024-06-11','2024-11-21','Modified','Microsoft Outlook Remote Code Execution Vulnerability',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'microsoft','365_apps, outlook, office',2),('CVE-2024-30104','2024-06-11','2024-11-21','Modified','Microsoft Office Remote Code Execution Vulnerability',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'microsoft','365_apps, office',2),('CVE-2024-30105','2024-07-09','2024-11-21','Modified','.NET and Visual Studio Denial of Service Vulnerability',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'microsoft','visual_studio_2022, .net',2),('CVE-2024-3011','2024-03-28','2025-01-15','Analyzed','A vulnerability was found in Tenda FH1205 2.0.0.7(775). It has been classified as critical. This affects the function formQuickIndex of the file /goform/QuickIndex. The manipulation of the argument PPPOEPassword leads to stack-based buffer overflow. It is possible to initiate the attack remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The identifier VDB-258297 was assigned to this vulnerability. NOTE: The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'tenda','fh1205_firmware, fh1205',8),('CVE-2024-3012','2024-03-28','2025-01-15','Analyzed','A vulnerability was found in Tenda FH1205 2.0.0.7(775). It has been declared as critical. This vulnerability affects the function GetParentControlInfo of the file /goform/GetParentControlInfo. The manipulation of the argument mac leads to stack-based buffer overflow. The attack can be initiated remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. VDB-258298 is the identifier assigned to this vulnerability. NOTE: The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'tenda','fh1205_firmware, fh1205',8),('CVE-2024-30128','2024-09-25','2024-09-26','Awaiting Analysis','HCL Nomad server on Domino is affected by an open proxy vulnerability in which an unauthenticated attacker can mask their original source IP address.  This may enable an attacker to trick the user into exposing sensitive information.',8.6,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:N/I:N/A:H',4.0,3.9,'','',1),('CVE-2024-30156','2024-03-24','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Varnish Cache before 7.3.2 and 7.4.x before 7.4.3 (and before 6.0.13 LTS), and Varnish Enterprise 6 before 6.0.12r6, allows credits exhaustion for an HTTP/2 connection control flow window, aka a Broke Window Attack.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'','',4),('CVE-2024-30157','2024-10-21','2024-11-21','Modified','A vulnerability in the Suite Applications Services component of Mitel MiCollab through 9.7.1.110 could allow an authenticated attacker with administrative privileges to conduct a SQL Injection attack due to insufficient validation of user input. A successful exploit could allow an attacker to execute arbitrary database and management operations.',7.2,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.2,'mitel','micollab',1),('CVE-2024-30158','2024-10-21','2024-10-25','Analyzed','A vulnerability in the web conferencing component of Mitel MiCollab through 9.7.1.110 could allow an authenticated attacker with administrative privileges to conduct a SQL Injection attack due to insufficient validation of user input. A successful exploit could allow an attacker to execute arbitrary database and management operations.',7.2,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.2,'mitel','micollab',1),('CVE-2024-3016','2024-05-14','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','NEC Platforms DT900 and DT900S Series 5.0.0.0 – v5.3.4.4, v5.4.0.0 – v5.6.0.20 allows an attacker to access a non-documented the system settings to change settings via local network with unauthenticated user.  ',9.1,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.2,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-30162','2024-06-07','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Invision Community through 4.7.16 allows remote code execution via the applications/core/modules/admin/editor/toolbar.php IPScoremodulesadmineditor_toolbar::addPlugin() method. This method handles uploaded ZIP files that are extracted into the applications/core/interface/ckeditor/ckeditor/plugins/ directory without properly verifying their content. This can be exploited by admin users (with the toolbar_manage permission) to write arbitrary PHP files into that directory, leading to execution of arbitrary PHP code in the context of the web server user.',7.2,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.2,'','',4),('CVE-2024-30163','2024-06-07','2025-03-19','Modified','Invision Community before 4.7.16 allow SQL injection via the applications/nexus/modules/front/store/store.php IPS\nexusmodulesfrontstore_store::_categoryView() method, where user input passed through the filter request parameter is not properly sanitized before being used to execute SQL queries. This can be exploited by unauthenticated attackers to carry out Blind SQL Injection attacks.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'invisioncommunity','invisioncommunity',4),('CVE-2024-30165','2024-05-28','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Amazon AWS Client VPN before 3.9.1 on macOS has a buffer overflow that could potentially allow a local actor to execute arbitrary commands with elevated permissions, a different vulnerability than CVE-2024-30164.',7.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.2,1.8,'','',2),('CVE-2024-30166','2024-04-03','2025-06-27','Analyzed','In Mbed TLS 3.3.0 through 3.5.2 before 3.6.0, a malicious client can cause information disclosure or a denial of service because of a stack buffer over-read (of less than 256 bytes) in a TLS 1.3 server via a TLS 3.1 ClientHello.',9.1,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H',5.2,3.9,'arm','mbed_tls',4),('CVE-2024-30170','2024-08-06','2024-08-12','Analyzed','PrivX before 34.0 allows data exfiltration and denial of service via the REST API. This is fixed in minor versions 33.1, 32.3, 31.3, and later, and in major version 34.0 and later,',9.1,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H',5.2,3.9,'ssh','privx',2),('CVE-2024-30172','2024-05-14','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','An issue was discovered in Bouncy Castle Java Cryptography APIs before 1.78. An Ed25519 verification code infinite loop can occur via a crafted signature and public key.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'','',4),('CVE-2024-3018','2024-03-30','2025-01-08','Analyzed','The Essential Addons for Elementor plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to PHP Object Injection in all versions up to, and including, 5.9.13 via deserialization of untrusted input from the \'error_resetpassword\' attribute of the \"Login | Register Form\" widget (disabled by default). This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with author-level access and above, to inject a PHP Object. If a POP chain is present via an additional plugin or theme installed on the target system, it could allow the attacker to delete arbitrary files, retrieve sensitive data, or execute code.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'wpdeveloper','essential_addons_for_elementor',4),('CVE-2024-30188','2024-08-12','2025-03-13','Modified','File read and write vulnerability in Apache DolphinScheduler ,  authenticated users can illegally access additional resource files. This issue affects Apache DolphinScheduler: from 3.1.0 before 3.2.2.  Users are recommended to upgrade to version 3.2.2, which fixes the issue.',8.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.2,2.8,'apache','dolphinscheduler',2),('CVE-2024-3019','2024-03-28','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','A flaw was found in PCP. The default pmproxy configuration exposes the Redis server backend to the local network, allowing remote command execution with the privileges of the Redis user. This issue can only be exploited when pmproxy is running. By default, pmproxy is not running and needs to be started manually. The pmproxy service is usually started from the \'Metrics settings\' page of the Cockpit web interface. This flaw affects PCP versions 4.3.4 and newer.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'','',20),('CVE-2024-30191','2024-04-09','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','A vulnerability has been identified in SCALANCE W