 The vulnerability is triggered when the malicious link is opened in a new tab using eit',8.7,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.8,2.3,'mintplexlabs','anythingllm',4),('CVE-2024-31103','2024-03-31','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation (\'Cross-site Scripting\') vulnerability in Kanban for WordPress Kanban Boards for WordPress allows Reflected XSS.This issue affects Kanban Boards for WordPress: from n/a through 2.5.21.  ',7.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:L',3.7,2.8,'','',2),('CVE-2024-31105','2024-04-02','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF) vulnerability in Adam Bowen Tax Rate Upload allows Reflected XSS.This issue affects Tax Rate Upload: from n/a through 2.4.5.  ',7.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:L',3.7,2.8,'','',2),('CVE-2024-31106','2024-03-31','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation (\'Cross-site Scripting\') vulnerability in Yooslider Yoo Slider allows Reflected XSS.This issue affects Yoo Slider: from n/a through 2.1.1.  ',7.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:L',3.7,2.8,'','',2),('CVE-2024-31107','2024-03-31','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation (\'Cross-site Scripting\') vulnerability in DiSo Development Team OpenID allows Reflected XSS.This issue affects OpenID: from n/a through 3.6.1.  ',7.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:L',3.7,2.8,'','',2),('CVE-2024-31109','2024-04-02','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF) vulnerability in Toastie Studio Woocommerce Social Media Share Buttons allows Stored XSS.This issue affects Woocommerce Social Media Share Buttons: from n/a through 1.3.0.  ',7.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:L',3.7,2.8,'','',2),('CVE-2024-31110','2024-03-31','2024-