EST API) and/or produce/consume messages or purge/delete destinations (using the Message REST API).  To mitigate, users can update the default conf/jetty.xml configuration file to add authentication requirement: <bean id=\"securityConstraintMapping\" class=\"org.eclipse.jetty.security.ConstraintMapping\">   <property name=\"constraint\" ref=\"securityConstraint\" />   <property name=\"pathSpec\" value=\"/\" /> </bean>  Or we encourage users to upgrade to Apache ActiveMQ 6.1.2 where the default configuration has been updated with authentication by default. ',8.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:H',5.8,2.1,'apache','activemq',2),('CVE-2024-32125','2024-04-15','2025-03-12','Analyzed','Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command (\'SQL Injection\') vulnerability in Booking Algorithms BA Book Everything.This issue affects BA Book Everything: from n/a through 1.6.4.  ',8.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:L',4.7,3.1,'ba-booking','ba_book_everything',2),('CVE-2024-32127','2024-04-15','2025-05-12','Analyzed','Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command (\'SQL Injection\') vulnerability in Markus Seyer Find Duplicates.This issue affects Find Duplicates: from n/a through 1.4.6.  ',8.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:L',4.7,3.1,'markusseyer','find_duplicates',2),('CVE-2024-32128','2024-04-15','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command (\'SQL Injection\') vulnerability in Realtyna Realtyna Organic IDX plugin.This issue affects Realtyna Organic IDX plugin: from n/a through 4.14.4.  ',9.3,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:L',4.7,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-32132','2024-04-15','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command (\'SQL Injection\') vulnerability in Codeboxr Team CBX Bookmark & Favorite.This issue affects CBX Bookmark