 affected by an Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory (\'Path Traversal\') vulnerability that could result in a security feature bypass. An attacker could exploit this vulnerability to access files and directories that are outside the restricted directory and also to overwrite arbitrary files. Exploitation of this issue does not requires user interaction and attack complexity is high.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.8,1.1,'adobe','acrobat_reader',2),('CVE-2024-3413','2024-04-06','2025-02-10','Analyzed','A vulnerability has been found in SourceCodester Human Resource Information System 1.0 and classified as critical. This vulnerability affects unknown code of the file initialize/login_process.php. The manipulation of the argument hr_email/hr_password leads to sql injection. The attack can be initiated remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. VDB-259582 is the identifier assigned to this vulnerability.',7.3,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L',3.4,3.9,'nelzkie15','human_resource_information_system',8),('CVE-2024-34133','2024-08-14','2024-08-15','Analyzed','Illustrator versions 28.5, 27.9.4 and earlier are affected by an out-of-bounds write vulnerability that could result in arbitrary code execution in the context of the current user. Exploitation of this issue requires user interaction in that a victim must open a malicious file.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'apple, adobe, microsoft','windows, illustrator, macos',1),('CVE-2024-34139','2024-07-09','2024-11-21','Modified','Bridge versions 14.0.4, 13.0.7, 14.1 and earlier are affected by an Integer Overflow or Wraparound vulnerability that could result in arbitrary code execution in the context of the current user. Exploitation of this issue requires user interaction in that a victim must open a malicious file.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'adobe','bridge',2),('CVE-2024-34144','2024-05-02','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','A sandbox bypass vulnerability involving crafted constructor bodies in Jenkins Script Security Plugin 1335.vf07d9ce377a_e and earlier allows attackers with permission to define and run sandboxed scripts, including Pipelines, to bypass the sandbox protection and execute arbitrary code in the context of the Jenkins controller JVM.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'','',4),('CVE-2024-34145','2024-05-02','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','A sandbox bypass vulnerability involving sandbox-defined classes that shadow specific non-sandbox-defined classes in Jenkins Script Security Plugin 1335.vf07d9ce377a_e and earlier allows attackers with permission to define and run sandboxed scripts, including Pipelines, to bypass the sandbox protection and execute arbitrary code in the context of the Jenkins controller JVM.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'','',4),('CVE-2024-34156','2024-09-06','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Calling Decoder.Decode on a message which contains deeply nested structures can cause a panic due to stack exhaustion. This is a follow-up to CVE-2022-30635.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'','',5),('CVE-2024-34158','2024-09-06','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Calling Parse on a \"// +build\" build tag line with deeply nested expressions can cause a panic due to stack exhaustion.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'','',5),('CVE-2024-34163','2024-08-14','2024-09-12','Analyzed','Improper input validation in firmware for some Intel(R) NUC may allow a privileged user to potentially enableescalation of privilege via local access.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:H/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,0.8,'intel','nuc_x15_laptop_kit_lapkc51e_firmware, nuc_x15_laptop_kit_lapbc710, nuc_x15_laptop_kit_lapkc71e, nuc_x15_laptop_kit_laprc510, nuc_x15_laptop_kit_lapac71g_firmware',1),('CVE-2024-34166','2025-01-14','2025-08-21','Analyzed','An os command injection vulnerability exists in the touchlist_sync.cgi touchlistsync() functionality of Wavlink AC3000 M33A8.V5030.210505. A specially crafted set of HTTP requests can lead to arbitrary code execution. An attacker can send an HTTP request to trigger this vulnerability.',10.0,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,3.9,'wavlink','wl-wn533a8, wl-wn533a8_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-34171','2024-05-30','2025-07-30','Analyzed','Fuji Electric Monitouch V-SFT  is vulnerable to a stack-based buffer overflow, which could allow an attacker to execute arbitrary code.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'fujielectric','monitouch_v-sft',2),('CVE-2024-34193','2024-05-20','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','smanga 3.2.7 does not filter the file parameter at the PHP/get file flow.php interface, resulting in a path traversal vulnerability that can cause arbitrary file reading.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N',3.6,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-34195','2024-08-28','2024-08-30','Analyzed','TOTOLINK AC1200 Wireless Router A3002R Firmware V1.1.1-B20200824 is vulnerable to Buffer Overflow. In the boa server program\'s CGI handling function formWlEncrypt, there is a lack of length restriction on the wlan_ssid field. This oversight leads to potential buffer overflow under specific circumstances. For instance, by invoking the formWlanRedirect function with specific parameters to alter wlan_idx\'s value and subsequently invoking the formWlEncrypt function, an attacker can trigger buffer overflow, enabling arbitrary command execution or denial of service attacks.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'totolink','a3002r, a3002r_firmware',1),('CVE-2024-34196','2024-05-14','2025-06-18','Analyzed','Totolink AC1200 Wireless Dual Band Gigabit Router A3002RU_V3 Firmware V3.0.0-B20230809.1615 is vulnerable to Buffer Overflow. The \"boa\" program allows attackers to modify the value of the \"vwlan_idx\" field via \"formMultiAP\". This can lead to a stack overflow through the \"formWlEncrypt\" CGI function by constructing malicious HTTP requests and passing a WLAN SSID value exceeding the expected length, potentially resulting in command execution or denial of service attacks.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'totolink','a3002ru-v3_firmware, a3002ru-v3',2),('CVE-2024-34198','2024-08-28','2025-07-03','Analyzed','TOTOLINK AC1200 Wireless Router A3002RU V2.1.1-B20230720.1011 is vulnerable to Buffer Overflow. The formWlEncrypt CGI handler in the boa program fails to limit the length of the wlan_ssid field from user input. This allows attackers to craft malicious HTTP requests by supplying an excessively long value for the wlan_ssid field, leading to a stack overflow. This can be further exploited to execute arbitrary commands or launch denial-of-service attacks.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'totolink','a3002ru_firmware, a3002ru',1),('CVE-2024-34199','2024-05-14','2025-06-13','Analyzed','TinyWeb 1.94 and below allows unauthenticated remote attackers to cause a denial of service (Buffer Overflow) when sending excessively large elements in the request line.',8.6,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:H',4.7,3.9,'ritlabs','tinyweb',2),('CVE-2024-34200','2024-05-14','2025-04-03','Analyzed','TOTOLINK CPE CP450 v4.1.0cu.747_B20191224 was discovered to contain a stack buffer overflow vulnerability in the setIpQosRules function.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'totolink','cp450_firmware, cp450',2),('CVE-2024-34201','2024-05-14','2025-04-03','Analyzed','TOTOLINK CP450 v4.1.0cu.747_B20191224 was discovered to contain a stack buffer overflow vulnerability in