eries that can be used to extract sensitive information from the database.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'custom_field_suite_project','custom_field_suite',8),('CVE-2024-35618','2024-05-24','2025-06-10','Analyzed','PingCAP TiDB v7.5.1 was discovered to contain a NULL pointer dereference via the component SortedRowContainer.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'pingcap','tidb',4),('CVE-2024-3562','2024-06-20','2024-11-21','Modified','The Custom Field Suite plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to PHP Code Injection in all versions up to, and including, 2.6.7 via the Loop custom field. This is due to insufficient sanitization of input prior to being used in a call to the eval() function. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with contributor-level access and above, to execute arbitrary PHP code on the server.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'custom_field_suite_project','custom_field_suite',8),('CVE-2024-35629','2024-06-04','2024-11-21','Modified','Improper Control of Filename for Include/Require Statement in PHP Program (\'PHP Remote File Inclusion\') vulnerability in Wow-Company Easy Digital Downloads – Recent Purchases allows PHP Remote File Inclusion.This issue affects Easy Digital Downloads – Recent Purchases: from n/a through 1.0.2.',9.6,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,2.8,'wow-company','easy_digital_downloads',2),('CVE-2024-35630','2024-06-03','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command (\'SQL Injection\') vulnerability in LJ Apps WP TripAdvisor Review Slider allows Blind SQL Injection.This issue affects WP TripAdvisor Review Slider: from n/a through 12.6.',7.6,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:L',4.7,2.3,'','',2),('CVE-2024-35631','2024-06-03','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Neutralization of Input Duri