nial of Service (DoS) when index parameter exceeds the range of shape.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'oneflow','oneflow',2),('CVE-2024-36743','2024-06-06','2025-05-02','Analyzed','An issue in OneFlow-Inc. Oneflow v0.9.1 allows attackers to cause a Denial of Service (DoS) when an empty array is processed with oneflow.dot.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'oneflow','oneflow',2),('CVE-2024-36745','2024-06-06','2025-03-25','Modified','An issue in OneFlow-Inc. Oneflow v0.9.1 allows attackers to cause a Denial of Service (DoS) via inputting a negative value into the oneflow.index_select parameter.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'oneflow','oneflow',2),('CVE-2024-3676','2024-05-14','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','The Proofpoint Encryption endpoint of Proofpoint Enterprise Protection contains an Improper Input Validation vulnerability that allows an unauthenticated remote attacker with a specially crafted HTTP request to create additional Encryption user accounts under the attacker\'s control.  These accounts are able to send spoofed email to any users within the domains configured by the Administrator.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N',3.6,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-36760','2024-06-13','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','A stack overflow vulnerability was found in version 1.18.0 of rhai. The flaw position is: (/ SRC/rhai/SRC/eval/STMT. Rs in rhai: : eval: : STMT: : _ $LT $impl $u20 $rhai.. engine.. Engine$GT$::eval_stmt::h3f1d68ce37fc6e96). Due to the stack overflow is a recursive call/SRC/rhai/SRC/eval/STMT. Rs file eval_stmt_block function.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-36761','2024-06-12','2025-05-23','Analyzed','naga v0.14.0 was discovered to contain a stack overflow via the component /wgsl/parse/mod.rs.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/U