ing a non default configuration, it might be possible to craft HTTP requests that bypass mTLS authentication to Cloud Foundry applications.   You are affected if you have route-services enabled in routing-release and have configured the haproxy-boshrelease property “ha_proxy.forwarded_client_cert” to “forward_only_if_route_service”.',9.1,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.2,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-37084','2024-07-25','2024-11-21','Modified','In Spring Cloud Data Flow versions prior to 2.11.4,  a malicious user who has access to the Skipper server api can use a crafted upload request to write an arbitrary file to any location on the file system which could lead to compromising the server',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'vmware','spring_cloud_data_flow',2),('CVE-2024-37089','2024-06-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory (\'Path Traversal\') vulnerability in StylemixThemes Consulting Elementor Widgets allows PHP Local File Inclusion.This issue affects Consulting Elementor Widgets: from n/a through 1.3.0.',9.0,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,2.2,'stylemixthemes','consulting_elementor_widgets',2),('CVE-2024-37090','2024-07-09','2024-11-21','Modified','Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command (\'SQL Injection\') vulnerability in StylemixThemes Masterstudy Elementor Widgets, StylemixThemes Consulting Elementor Widgets.This issue affects Masterstudy Elementor Widgets: from n/a through 1.2.2; Consulting Elementor Widgets: from n/a through 1.3.0.',8.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:L',4.7,3.1,'stylemixthemes','consulting_elementor_widgets, masterstudy_elementor_widgets',4),('CVE-2024-37091','2024-06-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in a Command (\'Command Injection\') vulnerability in StylemixThemes Consulting Elemen