ersal\') vulnerability in Crocoblock JetThemeCore allows File Manipulation.This issue affects JetThemeCore: from n/a before 2.2.1.',7.7,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:N/I:N/A:H',4.0,3.1,'','',2),('CVE-2024-3750','2024-05-16','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','The Visualizer: Tables and Charts Manager for WordPress plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to unauthorized modification and retrieval of data due to a missing capability check on the getQueryData() function in all versions up to, and including, 3.10.15. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with subscriber-level access and above, to perform arbitrary SQL queries that can be leveraged for privilege escalation among many other actions.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'','',8),('CVE-2024-37501','2024-07-09','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory (\'Path Traversal\') vulnerability in PluginsWare Advanced Classifieds & Directory Pro allows Path Traversal.This issue affects Advanced Classifieds & Directory Pro: from n/a through 3.1.3.',8.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,1.8,'','',2),('CVE-2024-37509','2024-07-21','2024-11-21','Modified','Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation (XSS or \'Cross-site Scripting\') vulnerability in Maksekeskus AS MakeCommerce for WooCommerce allows Reflected XSS.This issue affects MakeCommerce for WooCommerce: from n/a through 3.5.1.',7.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:L',3.7,2.8,'makecommerce','makecommerce_for_woocommerce',2),('CVE-2024-37513','2024-07-09','2024-11-21','Modified','Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory (\'Path Traversal\') vulnerability in Themewinter WPCafe allows Path Traversal.This issue affects WPCafe: from n/a through 2.2.27.',8.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,1.8,'themewinter','wpcafe',2),('CVE-2024-375