he argument PPPOEPassword leads to stack-based buffer overflow. The attack can be initiated remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. VDB-261142 is the identifier assigned to this vulnerability. NOTE: The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'tenda','ac500, ac500_firmware',8),('CVE-2024-39063','2024-07-09','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Lime Survey <= 6.5.12 is vulnerable to Cross Site Request Forgery (CSRF). The YII_CSRF_TOKEN is only checked when passed in the body of POST requests, but the same check isn\'t performed in the equivalent GET requests.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'','',2),('CVE-2024-39069','2024-07-09','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','An issue in ifood Order Manager v3.35.5 \'Gestor de Peddios.exe\' allows attackers to execute arbitrary code via a DLL hijacking attack.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'','',4),('CVE-2024-3907','2024-04-17','2025-01-17','Analyzed','A vulnerability was found in Tenda AC500 2.0.1.9(1307). It has been rated as critical. This issue affects the function formSetCfm of the file /goform/setcfm. The manipulation of the argument funcpara1 leads to stack-based buffer overflow. The attack may be initiated remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The associated identifier of this vulnerability is VDB-261143. NOTE: The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'tenda','ac500, ac500_firmware',8),('CVE-2024-39071','2024-07-09','2024-11-21','Awaiting Analysis','Fujian Kelixun <=7.6.6.4391 is vulnerable to SQL Injection in send_event.php.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-3909','2024-04-17','2025-