GH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'jonschlinkert','braces',10),('CVE-2024-40681','2024-09-07','2025-08-15','Analyzed','IBM MQ 9.1 LTS, 9.2 LTS, 9.3 LTS, 9.3 CD, 9.4 LTS, and 9.4 CD could allow an authenticated user in a specifically defined role, to bypass security restrictions and execute actions against the queue manager.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.6,'ibm','mq_operator, supplied_mq_advanced_container_images',1),('CVE-2024-40691','2024-12-03','2024-12-11','Analyzed','IBM Cognos Controller 11.0.0 and 11.0.1   could be vulnerable to malicious file upload by not validating the content of the file uploaded to the web interface. Attackers can make use of this weakness and upload malicious executable files into the system, and it can be sent to victim for performing further attacks.',8.0,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.1,'ibm','cognos_controller',1),('CVE-2024-40693','2025-01-24','2025-03-05','Analyzed','IBM Planning Analytics 2.0 and 2.1 could be vulnerable to malicious file upload by not validating the content of the file uploaded to the web interface. Attackers can make use of this weakness and upload malicious executable files into the system, and it can be sent to victim for performing further attacks.',8.0,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.1,'ibm','planning_analytics',1),('CVE-2024-40695','2024-12-20','2025-07-02','Analyzed','IBM Cognos Analytics 11.2.0 through 11.2.4 FP4 and   12.0.0 through 12.0.4    could be vulnerable to malicious file upload by not validating the content of the file uploaded to the web interface. Attackers can make use of this weakness and upload malicious executable files into the system, and it can be sent to victim for performing further attacks.',8.0,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.1,'ibm','cognos_analytics',1),('CVE-2024-40697','2024-08-13','2024-08-22','Analyzed','IBM Common Licensing 9.0 does not require that users should have strong passwords by default, which makes it easier for attackers to compromise user accounts.  IBM X-Force ID:  297895.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N',3.6,3.9,'ibm','common_licensing',2),('CVE-2024-40702','2025-01-07','2025-07-03','Analyzed','IBM Cognos Controller 11.0.0 through 11.0.1 and IBM Controller 11.1.0 could allow an unauthorized user to obtain valid tokens to gain access to protected resources due to improper certificate validation.',8.2,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:L/A:N',4.2,3.9,'microsoft, ibm','cognos_controller, windows, controller',1),('CVE-2024-40709','2024-09-07','2024-09-09','Awaiting Analysis','A missing authorization vulnerability allows a local low-privileged user on the machine to escalate their privileges to root level.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.0','CVSS:3.0/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'','',1),('CVE-2024-40710','2024-09-07','2025-05-01','Analyzed','A series of related high-severity vulnerabilities, the most notable enabling remote code execution (RCE) as the service account and extraction of sensitive information (savedcredentials and passwords). Exploiting these vulnerabilities requires a user who has been assigned a low-privileged role within Veeam Backup & Replication.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'veeam','veeam_backup_&_replication',1),('CVE-2024-40711','2024-09-07','2024-12-20','Analyzed','A deserialization of untrusted data vulnerability with a malicious payload can allow an unauthenticated remote code execution (RCE).',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'veeam','veeam_backup_&_replication',2),('CVE-2024-40712','2024-09-07','2025-05-01','Analyzed','A path traversal vulnerability allows an attacker with a low-privileged account and local access to the system to perform local privilege escalation (LPE).',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'veeam','veeam_backup_&_replication',1),('CVE-2024-40713','2024-09-07','2025-05-01','Analyzed','A vulnerability that allows a user who has been assigned a low-privileged role within Veeam Backup & Replication to alter Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) settings and bypass MFA.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'veeam','veeam_backup_&_replication',1),('CVE-2024-40714','2024-09-07','2025-05-01','Analyzed','An improper certificate validation vulnerability in TLS certificate validation allows an attacker on the same network to intercept sensitive credentials during restore operations.',8.3,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,1.6,'veeam','veeam_backup_&_replication',1),('CVE-2024-40715','2024-11-07','2025-07-11','Analyzed','A vulnerability in Veeam Backup & Replication Enterprise Manager has been identified, which allows attackers to perform authentication bypass. Attackers must be able to perform Man-in-the-Middle (MITM) attack to exploit this vulnerability.',7.7,'HIGH','v3.0','CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:L',5.5,2.2,'veeam','veeam_backup_&_replication',1),('CVE-2024-40717','2024-12-04','2025-04-24','Analyzed','A vulnerability in Veeam Backup & Replication allows a low-privileged user with certain roles to perform remote code execution (RCE) by updating existing jobs. These jobs can be configured to run pre- and post-scripts, which can be located on a network share and are executed with elevated privileges by default. The user can update a job and schedule it to run almost immediately, allowing arbitrary code execution on the server.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'veeam','veeam_backup_&_replication',1),('CVE-2024-40718','2024-09-07','2024-09-09','Awaiting Analysis','A server side request forgery vulnerability allows a low-privileged user to perform local privilege escalation through explo