nd not a DoS vulnerability.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-41435','2024-09-03','2025-07-03','Analyzed','YugabyteDB v2.21.1.0 was discovered to contain a buffer overflow via the \"insert into\" parameter.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'yugabyte','yugabytedb',2),('CVE-2024-41436','2024-09-03','2025-07-03','Analyzed','ClickHouse v24.3.3.102 was discovered to contain a buffer overflow via the component DB::evaluateConstantExpressionImpl.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'clickhouse','clickhouse',2),('CVE-2024-41444','2024-08-26','2024-09-05','Analyzed','SeaCMS v12.9 has a SQL injection vulnerability in the key parameter of /js/player/dmplayer/dmku/index.php?ac=so.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'seacms','seacms',3),('CVE-2024-4145','2024-06-13','2024-11-21','Modified','The Search & Replace WordPress plugin before 3.2.2 does not sanitize and escape a parameter before using it in a SQL statement, allowing admins to perform SQL injection attacks (such as within a multi-site network).',7.2,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.2,'wp-media','search_&_replace',2),('CVE-2024-41459','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability via the PPPOEPassword parameter at ip/goform/QuickIndex.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-4146','2024-06-08','2024-11-21','Modified','In lunary-ai/lunary version v1.2.13, an incorrect authorization vulnerability exists that allows unauthorized users to access and manipulate projects within an organization they should not have access to. Specifically, the vulnerability is located in the `checkProjectAccess` method within the authorization middleware, which fails to adequately verify if a user has the correct permissions to access a specific project. Instead, it only checks if the user is part of the organization owning the project, overlooking the necessary check against the `account_project` table for explicit project access rights. This flaw enables attackers to gain complete control over all resources within a project, including the ability to create, update, read, and delete any resource, compromising the privacy and security of sensitive information.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'lunary','lunary',4),('CVE-2024-41460','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability via the entrys parameter at ip/goform/RouteStatic.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41461','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability via the list1 parameter at ip/goform/DhcpListClient.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41462','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability via the page parameter at ip/goform/DhcpListClient.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41463','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability via the entrys parameter at ip/goform/addressNat.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41464','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability via the mitInterface parameter in ip/goform/RouteStatic',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41465','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability via the funcpara1 parameter at ip/goform/setcfm.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41466','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability via the page parameter at ip/goform/NatStaticSetting.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41468','2024-07-25','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a command injection vulnerability via the cmdinput parameter at /goform/exeCommand',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41473','2024-07-25','2024-11-21','Modified','Tenda FH1201 v1.2.0.14 was discovered to contain a command injection vulnerability via the mac parameter at ip/goform/WriteFacMac',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'tendacn','fh1201, fh1201_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41475','2024-08-12','2024-09-18','Analyzed','Gnuboard g6 6.0.7 is vulnerable to Session hijacking due to a CORS misconfiguration.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'sir','gnuboard',1),('CVE-2024-41476','2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Awaiting Analysis','AMTT Hotel Broadband Operation System (HiBOS) V3.0.3.151204 and before is vulnerable to SQL Injection via /manager/card/card_detail.php.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-4148','2024-06-01','2025-01-30','Modified','A Regular Expression Denial of Service (ReDoS) vulnerability exists in the lunary-ai/lunary application, version 1.2.10. An attacker can exploit this vulnerability by maliciously manipulating regular expressions, which can significantly impact the response time of the application and potentially render it completely non-functional. Specifically, the vulnerability can be triggered by sending a specially crafted request to the application, leading to a denial of service where the application crashes.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'lunary','lunary',3),('CVE-2024-41492','2024-07-19','2025-04-07','Analyzed','A stack overflow in Tenda AX1806 v1.0.0.1 allows attackers to cause a Denial of Service (DoS) via a crafted input.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H',3.6,3.9,'tenda','ax1806, ax1806_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-4151','2024-05-20','2025-01-31','Modified','An Improper Access Control vulnerability exists in lunary-ai/lunary version 1.2.2, where users can view and update any prompts in any projects due to insufficient access control checks in the handling of PATCH and GET requests for template versions. This vulnerability allows unauthorized users to manipulate or access sensitive project data, potentially leading to data integrity and confidentiality issues.',8.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.2,2.8,'lunary','lunary',3),('CVE-2024-41512','2024-10-04','2025-06-02','Analyzed','A SQL Injection vulnerability in \"ccHandler.aspx\" in all versions of CADClick v.1.11.0 and before allows remote attackers to execute arbitrary SQL commands via the \"bomid\" parameter.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'4pace','cadclick',3),('CVE-2024-41518','2024-08-02','2024-09-03','Modified','An Incorrect Access Control vulnerability in \"/admin/programm/<program_id>/export/statistics\" in Feripro <= v2.2.3 allows remote attackers to export an XLSX file with information about registrations and participants.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N',3.6,3.9,'mecodia','feripro',3),('CVE-2024-41550','2024-07-24','2025-05-28','Analyzed','CampCodes Supplier Management System v1.0 is vulnerable to SQL injection via Supply_Management_System/admin/view_invoice_items.php?id= .',7.2,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.2,'campcodes','supplier_management_system',2),('CVE-2024-41551','2024-07-24','2024-11-21','Modified','CampCodes Supplier Management System v1.0 is vulnerable to SQL injection via Supply_Management_System/admin/view_order_items.php?id= .',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'campcodes','supplier_management_system',2),('CVE-2024-4157','2024-05-22','2025-02-06','Analyzed','The Contact Form Plugin by Fluent Forms for Quiz, Survey, and Drag & Drop WP Form Builder plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to PHP Object Injection in all versions up to, and including, 5.1.15 via deserialization of untrusted input in the extractDynamicValues function. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with contributor-level access and above, to inject a PHP Object. If a POP chain is present via an additional plugin or theme installed on the target system, it could allow the attacker to delete arbitrary files, retrieve sensitive data, or execute code. Successful exploitation requires the attacker to have \"View Form\" and \"Manage Form\" permissions, which must be explicitly set by an administrator. However, this requirement can be bypassed when this vulnerability is chained with CVE-2024-2771.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.6,'fluentforms','contact_form',4),('CVE-2024-41570','2024-08-12','2024-08-29','Analyzed','An Unauthenticated Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) in demon callback handling in Havoc 2 0.7 allows attackers to send arbitrary network traffic originating from the team server.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'havocframework','havoc',1),('CVE-2024-41577','2024-08-12','2024-11-05','Awaiting Analysis','An arbitrary file upload vulnerability in the Ueditor component of productinfoquick v1.0 allows attackers to execute arbitrary code via uploading a crafted PNG file.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'','',1),('CVE-2024-41579','2024-12-05','2024-12-11','Awaiting Analysis','DTStack Taier 1.4.0 allows remote attackers to specify the jobName parameter in the console listNames function to cause a SQL injection vulnerability',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'','',2),('CVE-2024-41586','2024-10-03','2025-04-10','Analyzed','A stack-based Buffer Overflow vulnerability in DrayTek Vigor310 devices through 4.3.2.6 allows a remote attacker to execute arbitrary code via a long query string to the cgi-bin/ipfedr.cgi component.',8.0,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.1,'draytek','vigor3910_firmware, vigor3910',2),('CVE-2024-41588','2024-10-03','2025-06-11','Analyzed','The CGI endpoints v2x00.cgi and cgiwcg.cgi of DrayTek Vigor3910 devices through 4.3.2.6 are vulnerable to buffer overflows, by authenticated users, because of missing bounds checking on parameters passed through POST requests to the strncpy function.',8.0,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.1,'draytek','vigor2620, vigor2915, vigor2925_firmware, vigor2765_firmware, vigor1000b_firmware',2),('CVE-2024-41589','2024-10-03','2025-04-10','Analyzed','DrayTek Vigor310 devices through 4.3.2.6 use unencrypted HTTP for authentication requests.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.8,'draytek','vigor3910_firmware, vigor3910',2),('CVE-2024-41590','2024-10-03','2025-06-11','Analyzed','Several CGI endpoints are vulnerable to buffer overflows, by authenticated users, because of miss