 , there is a possible access of another app\'s files due to a missing permission check. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',2),('CVE-2024-4309','2024-04-29','2025-04-23','Analyzed','SQL injection vulnerability in HubBank affecting version 1.0.2. This vulnerability could allow an attacker to send a specially crafted SQL query to the database through different endpoints (/user/transaction.php?id=1, /user/credit-debit_transaction.php?id=1,/user/view_transaction. php?id=1 and  /user/viewloantrans.php?id=1, id parameter) and retrieve the information stored in the database.',8.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.2,2.8,'ofofonobsdev','hubbank',2),('CVE-2024-43091','2024-11-13','2024-12-17','Analyzed','In filterMask of SkEmbossMaskFilter.cpp, there is a possible out of bounds write due to an integer overflow. This could lead to remote code execution with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is not needed for exploitation.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'google','android',2),('CVE-2024-43093','2024-11-13','2024-11-14','Analyzed','In shouldHideDocument of ExternalStorageProvider.java, there is a possible bypass of a file path filter designed to prevent access to sensitive directories due to  incorrect unicode normalization. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no additional execution privileges needed. User interaction is needed for exploitation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'google','android',2),('CVE-2024-43095','2025-01-21','2025-04-22','Analyzed','In multiple locations, there is a possible way to obtain any system permission due to a logic error in the code. This could lead to local escalation of privilege with no