_DESTROY sub-request in parallel can panic the kernel or enable further Use-After-Free attacks, potentially including code execution or Capsicum sandbox escape.',10.0,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,3.9,'freebsd','freebsd',2),('CVE-2024-43106','2024-12-18','2024-12-19','Undergoing Analysis','A library injection vulnerability exists in Microsoft Excel 16.83 for macOS. A specially crafted library can leverage Excel\'s access privileges, leading to a permission bypass. A malicious application could inject a library and start the program to trigger this vulnerability and then make use of the vulnerable application\'s permissions.',7.1,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N',5.2,1.8,'','',3),('CVE-2024-43107','2025-03-10','2025-03-10','Awaiting Analysis','Improper Certificate Validation (CWE-295) in the Gallagher Milestone Integration Plugin (MIP) permits unauthenticated messages (e.g. alarm events) to be sent to the Plugin. This issue effects Gallagher MIPS Plugin v4.0 prior to v4.0.32, all versions of v3.0 and prior.',7.2,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:N/I:L/A:L',2.7,3.9,'','',1),('CVE-2024-43110','2024-09-05','2024-09-05','Analyzed','The ctl_request_sense function could expose up to three bytes of the kernel heap to userspace.  Malicious software running in a guest VM that exposes virtio_scsi can exploit the vulnerabilities to achieve code execution on the host in the bhyve userspace process, which typically runs as root.  Note that bhyve runs in a Capsicum sandbox, so malicious code is constrained by the capabilities available to the bhyve process.  A malicious iSCSI initiator could achieve remote code execution on the iSCSI target host.',8.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H',6.0,2.0,'freebsd','freebsd',1),('CVE-2024-43114','2024-08-06','2024-09-11','Analyzed','In JetBrains TeamCity before 2024.07.1 possible privilege escalation due to incorrect directory permissio