, fastconnect_7800, wsa8845h_firmware, wcd9385_firmware',1),('CVE-2024-45552','2025-04-07','2025-04-07','Awaiting Analysis','Information disclosure may occur during a video call if a device resets due to a non-conforming RTCP packet that doesn`t adhere to RFC standards.',8.2,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:L',4.2,3.9,'','',1),('CVE-2024-45553','2025-01-06','2025-08-11','Analyzed','Memory corruption can occur when process-specific maps are added to the global list. If a map is removed from the global list while another thread is using it for a process-specific task, issues may arise.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'qualcomm','qfw7124_firmware, sxr2250p_firmware, fastconnect_7800, snapdragon_8+_gen_2_mobile_firmware, wcd9390',1),('CVE-2024-45554','2025-05-06','2025-05-09','Analyzed','Memory corruption during concurrent SSR execution due to race condition on the global maps list.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'qualcomm','sxr2250p_firmware, fastconnect_7800, sw5100, snapdragon_429_mobile_firmware, qca6174a_firmware',1),('CVE-2024-45555','2025-01-06','2025-01-13','Analyzed','Memory corruption can occur if an already verified IFS2 image is overwritten, bypassing boot verification. This allows unauthorized programs to be injected into security-sensitive images, enabling the booting of a tampered IFS2 system image.',8.4,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.5,'qualcomm','qam8775p_firmware, qca6564a, sa6150p, qamsrv1m_firmware, qca6564a_firmware',1),('CVE-2024-45557','2025-04-07','2025-08-19','Analyzed','Memory corruption can occur when TME processes addresses from TZ and MPSS requests without proper validation.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'qualcomm','qfw7124_firmware, fastconnect_7800, wcd9390, sm8635, qcs4490_firmware',1),('CVE-2024-45558','2025-01-06','2025-08-11','Analyzed','Transient D