cess Control. The /upload route is accessible without authentication, allowing any user to upload files.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'davidguva','openvidreview',3),('CVE-2024-4607','2024-08-05','2024-09-10','Analyzed','Use After Free vulnerability in Arm Ltd Bifrost GPU Kernel Driver, Arm Ltd Valhall GPU Kernel Driver, Arm Ltd Arm 5th Gen GPU Architecture Kernel Driver allows a local non-privileged user to make improper GPU memory processing operations to gain access to already freed memory.This issue affects Bifrost GPU Kernel Driver: from r41p0 through r49p0; Valhall GPU Kernel Driver: from r41p0 through r49p0; Arm 5th Gen GPU Architecture Kernel Driver: from r41p0 through r49p0.',7.8,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,1.8,'arm','bifrost_gpu_kernel_driver, valhall_gpu_kernel_driver, 5th_gen_gpu_architecture_kernel_driver',1),('CVE-2024-46076','2024-10-07','2025-05-15','Analyzed','RuoYi v4.7.9 and before has a security flaw that allows escaping from comments within the code generation feature, enabling the injection of malicious code.',9.8,'CRITICAL','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,3.9,'ruoyi','ruoyi',2),('CVE-2024-46078','2024-10-04','2025-04-23','Analyzed','itsourcecode Sports Management System Project 1.0 is vulnerable to SQL Injection in the function delete_category of the file sports_scheduling/player.php via the argument id.',7.5,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N',3.6,3.9,'adonesevangelista','sports_management_system',1),('CVE-2024-46080','2024-10-01','2025-04-28','Analyzed','Scriptcase v9.10.023 and before is vulnerable to Remote Code Execution (RCE) via the nm_zip function.',8.0,'HIGH','v3.1','CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H',5.9,2.1,'scriptcase','scriptcase',1),('CVE-2024-46084','2024-10-01','2025-04-28','Analyzed','Scriptcase 9.10.023 and before is vulnerable to Remote Code Execution (RCE) via the nm_unzip functi